@startuml j4-staff-reply
!include style.iuml
title J4 Staff reply into the patient's chat
actor Staff
participant "Staff page /staff\n(StaffClient)" as SP
participant "/api/tickets" as T
participant "desk.ts\n(isStaff)" as D
database "Shared store\n(db.ts)" as Store
participant "GET /api/messages" as Msg
participant "Chat page /\n(ChatClient)" as Chat
actor Patient
autonumber

Staff -> SP : opens /staff
SP -> T : GET (reloaded every 4 seconds)
T -> D : isStaff(request)
note right of D
The desk lock is optional and off on the live site.
When it is on, the code travels in the x-desk-code
header; without it the answer is 401 and the page asks for it.
end note
T -> Store : listTickets()
T --> SP : tickets without their chat ids, shared: true or false
SP --> Staff : order urgent, needs human, answered, closed;\na reply box on each ticket; the "To call back" list
note right of SP : a waiting ticket older than 2 hours is marked overdue

Staff -> SP : types a reply on a ticket and sends it
SP -> T : POST {ticketId, reply}
T -> Store : replyToTicket: reply saved, status answered,\nmessage added to that chat with role staff
T --> SP : the ticket, again without its chat id
SP --> Staff : "Reply sent"

loop every 3 seconds
  Chat -> Msg : GET ?chatId=<this browser's chat id>
  Msg -> Store : listMessages(chatId)
  Msg --> Chat : messages
end
Chat --> Patient : the staff reply, in that patient's chat and only there

opt nothing more is owed
  Staff -> SP : Close
  SP -> T : POST {ticketId, close: true}
  T -> Store : closeTicket: status closed
end
@enduml
